{"id":"4773","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4773_main_zoomed-image-of-line-of-cumulus-congestus-cumulonimbus-calvus-and-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在发展良好的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状鬃积雨云</span>细胞前面是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>的侧翼线。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">远处的降水</span>从后一线降下。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎</span>积云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡</span>积云的云碎片在最明显的位置。图片其他位置是由积雨云部分扩散形成的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>许多斑块和可能的层积云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Rodney Hale","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国中央贝德福德郡MK45贝德福德Houghton Conquest","latitude":"纬度: 52° 4' 5'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 28' 18'' W","date":"25 August 2012 1436 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 6, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4773_syn_zoomed-image-of-line-of-cumulus-congestus-cumulonimbus-calvus-and-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>当低压系统向东移动穿过威尔士和英格兰中部时，这张图显示了不稳定的情况。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4773_upper_zoomed-image-of-line-of-cumulus-congestus-cumulonimbus-calvus-and-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在268 hPa，从表面到对流层顶有条件地不稳定和潮湿</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4773_sat_zoomed-image-of-line-of-cumulus-congestus-cumulonimbus-calvus-and-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>英格兰南部和中部的积雨云细胞</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2012","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4752_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>该图显示了积雨云上升云塔的大型垂直范围。顶部被傍晚的太阳照亮，左侧呈现明亮的白色，而云的其余部分则更暗。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右上方的云是纤维状的</span>，表明是鬃状云云种，右侧有一个砧状切变 - 这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状附加特征</span>。云的顶部（从这个角度看）<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">正在失去锐度</span>，因为这个细胞从浓积云转变为积雨云。在云层之下，太阳照亮了一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">强大的降水轴</span> - 降水性补充特征。几乎围绕强大对流云的深灰色云层是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>，而左上方的白色纤维云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frann Brothers","location":"美国德克萨斯州得林瓜","latitude":"纬度: 29° 19' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 103° 36' 58'' W","date":"21 August 2014 1800 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.3"}]}]}